entr(input, *, out=None) -> Tensor
Computes the entropy on :attr:`input` (as defined below), elementwise.

.. math::
    \begin{align}
    \text{entr(x)} = \begin{cases}
        -x * \ln(x)  & x > 0 \\
        0 &  x = 0.0 \\
        -\infty & x < 0
    \end{cases}
    \end{align}


Args:
